# @var BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

### Health Check
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/health

### Login (get token first)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get All Grants
# @var TOKEN={{@prompt("Enter your JWT token")}}
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get All Work Orders
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get All Customers
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get Dashboard Financial Data
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/financial/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
